  "description": "<p>This task involves  defining java interfaces for Persistent Storage and Transaction interfaces defined here: <a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=133366058\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=133366058</a>.   It would also be good to check prior art with respect to Spring's transactional framework(s) to see if it makes sense for us to use established patterns.</p>",
